p-4EFgMhH_jT7t30Q&oe=6AC66161"}, {"file_name": "Gungi 2-2560x1440.png", "id": "1113992063485287", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974497_1113992066818620_843721057957030660_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l3NUH-xOzqQQ7kNvwE1amSr&_nc_oc=AdoRbl3A99UVKe3IuHYwrmlmXiI6tnoJx84XQxUCvJFZj7SyW1iK6T8UOzeTFL-PM6U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOq9rwa97VhS0m8l0hhFzXacq2MNlFPHqcMg8VW72kz8A&oe=6AC64913"}, {"file_name": "Chess cropped.png", "id": "902765531159168", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984463_902765534492501_3956653358745274292_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qvTY477uazAQ7kNvwGN1ZXN&_nc_oc=AdoWs1aa_j5wMSeeJulA2eUYzyRuQtU23kyynzxJkHswsm6G7ymYFPOEHiExHjwPTDw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMqZN6xzJyYXnB7dA3RK1qVPTuW-FL9mVq-cpX1VA1fGA&oe=6AC652A3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerScreenshot cropped.png", "id": "717849803637730", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982545_717849806971063_8753740338935084738_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rePeDuwFrvIQ7kNvwFROwDH&_nc_oc=AdpeG4vlxvgWoXh2cv1D5qsADAld42hdko2S3p6YD65JWtJrXevyPD9dla8nDWqHNTM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPgjsNcAHRE3CTXYMMfL1H60E0avUJV-pI2kbKZ2Ajtow&oe=6AC66C7B"}, "display_name": "VRShogiMates", "keywords": ["shogi", "chess", "xiangqi", "chushogi", "gungi"], "long_description": "Welcome to VRShogiMates, your gateway to a captivating virtual realm of classic board games! As a solo developer's passion project, this app delivers an unparalleled experience featuring Shogi, Chu Shogi, Chess, Xiangqi, and the unique Gungi from Hunter X Hunter.\n\nMultiplayer Mode:\nChallenge opponents worldwide in real-time or correspondence matches. Whether facing friends or discovering new adversaries, the global multiplayer functionality ensures a dynamic and engaging experience.\n\nHow to play:\nNew to these intricate games? No problem! VRShogiMates provides comprehensive rules, instructions, and a game record for each game type to help you learn. Explore the rules, grasp essential strategies, and elevate your skills!\n\nRegular Updates and Support:\nMy commitment doesn't end at launch. Expect continuous updates, bug fixes, performance enhancements, and exciting new features driven by valuable feedback from us.\n\nUnique Highlights:\nVenture into the unexplored VR realms of Shogi, Chu Shogi, Xiangqi, and Gungi - experiences currently not offered by any other VR app on the market! The last game type, Gungi, brings a touch of fantasy to your gaming repertoire. It\u2019s refreshingly different from other board games, check it out!\n\nEmbark on this virtual journey, where tradition meets innovation, and every move is a step towards victory. VRShogiMates is not just a game; it's a portal to a world where strategy, competition, and community converge. Join us and redefine your board gaming experience!", "short_description": "Dive into the immersive world of board games with VRShogiMates! Play Shogi, Chu Shogi, Chess, Xiangqi, and Gungi in a stunning virtual environment. Challenge friends globally in real-time or turn-based multiplayer. Learn the rules for all the games, while enjoying regular updates for an ever-evolving gaming experience.\n\nInternet connection is required to play. (For now)\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSqXvliv35vQxAmBcivKWHTeZU6uYtvVl-AYDhYR_j2g0rZeRh3vWME8K8kepbFus4YikVBZ3adYVrt/pub", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "David Laszlo Banfai", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vrshogimates.wixsite.com/home", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": 